# Optional backend base URL override (no trailing slash, no /api suffix).
#
# Leave this UNSET. By default the frontend calls the API at the
# same-origin /api path in both development and production:
#   - Development: the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:8000
#     (configured in vite.config.ts; override the target with
#      VITE_DEV_BACKEND_URL if your backend runs elsewhere).
#   - Production: Vercel Services routes /api to the backend service on the
#     same origin.
#
# Set this only if you need to target a backend on a different origin,
# for example a separately hosted API:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com
